# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P8, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0.
# "# @" marks the listening times (tools/make_manual.py --times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tapkey w7
tap PLAY
wait 2500
tap FX
turn K1 15 40
turn K2 35 40
wait 500
wav warble.wav
# @ P8 Sibyl with its echoes up (Space): clear repeats of the two voices
wait 1500
tap LFO
tap LFO
# @ Delay up (Mods): the LFO wobbles the delay's time, and every echo bends in pitch
turn K3 60 40
wait 5000
shot warble-0.png
tap FX
tap FX
# @ a longer Time (Details): deeper, slower bends
turn K2 15 60
wait 6000
shot warble-1.png
wavstop
